<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka says tenders for 12,500 tonnes of sugar.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka says tenders for 12,500 tonnes of sugar.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka has floated a tender to buy 12,500 tonnes of sugar for delivery in Colombo in the first half of June, an official of the Co-operative Wholesale Establishment, the state buying arm, said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender closes on 11 April at 9.30 am (0330 GMT), the official said.</p>
